z5h = z3x + RISK_TTL 40 (tools/bundle.sh z5h zl0 z3x z5g; new switch, constant-folded, no bytecode change). TrapRisk
marks every seen enemy baby's three front tiles, and a baby's step avoids tiles within Chebyshev 1 of a live mark
while no enemy is within dist2 20 and Nav.stall < 8. The marks lived 150 rounds; now 40. The TTL was never varied
(attempts.csv: TRAP_RISK only ablated whole, u3p, and gated by map area, u3s).

