walled home pocket (YokoOno's: 10-25% inside its own), and 44% of all our rat turns were inside with no enemy within
dist2 20, where the mask steers. Our middle-band (y 8-21) rat-rounds in r1-300: 408 of 6,888 (as A in 18682 g0: 1,938
of 6,229). Locally vs araid as B the share inside falls to 0.13-0.20 by r150. Whether stale marks are what holds the
rats in is not shown; z1m-z1p (flow), u5x (SYM_FILL) and z3v (WALL_HOLD) targeted the same pocket by other routes.

